<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 382)</h2>
<p><b>Welcome to Asobi Review.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Open the invite file you were sent (double-click it, or File → Open) and you're in the review — playing, commenting, and drawing with your name already on your notes. Without an invite you can still open media you've been given and review it on your own.</li>
<li>Updates arrive automatically, like this one.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
